  "message.8c154f1307a0": "They have {arg5} Patience. Build the crux up, then pick your moment to go all-in. At zero, the meeting is over. {arg6} Suspicion and they walk out: failures and spells both add to it.",
  "message.2dc2930952ed": "Some are",
  "message.ef9d7e1e5b52": ": crowns, Health, Renown or a spell cast for them. Meet one and Confronting it is certain (you pay what it asks); if you can’t, it fails. Each card’s icon shows what it tests or asks.",
  "message.a8c68a3a327a": "About one argument in six does something more, shown on a banner across it: a",
  "message.9b64c1c869ad": "Sore point",
  "message.a9414977ca56": "bars the crux until you answer it, an",
  "message.f4b13e93df07": "Opening",
  "message.f54f0cbc183f": "makes your next push free when you win it, a",
  "message.b02a1c419948": "Watchful",
  "message.4c5eae0669af": "one makes every spell cost more Suspicion while it stands, and so on.",
  "message.12eccfc7ce4b": ", at the Mana prices shown. Each breaks one rule over the whole table (Foresight rolls every argument’s dice before you choose, Haste confronts them all at once, Seal clears the table), and",
  "message.9f9e640289c2": "every cast is seen: +1 Suspicion",
  "message.768c36c4090a": "(Foresight and Haste +2), shown in the tile’s corner. A spell that would make them walk out can’t be cast. Pick a spell to see exactly what it would do; pick it again, or Cast.",
  "message.97b39ebac2f0": "In a few informal meetings they have magic too: one of their arguments is",
  "message.b358c76f7d35": "their spell",
  "message.6eee131435fa": ". It can’t be deflected.",
  "message.a5e2acc1652d": "it (an Arcana check; it stays if you fail) or counter it with",
  "message.b311172dd9a4": "Ward",
  "message.9bd75a3fb14a": "Reflect",
  "message.219f28f53992": "; left too long, it lands. The man in grey’s Compulsion loses you the meeting.",
  "message.5ad3dbd1242a": "Got it",
  "message.462918c4e86b": "Keep talking",
  "message.92b666f9e82a": "Engine: {arg0}",
  "message.de3c140d4f51": "depth {arg0}",
  "message.ea420394a248": "Engine · {arg0} · {arg1} positions{arg2}",
  "message.8f60fe92dfe6": "Engine · thinking…",
  "message.eb27bddd7986": "Attack them? The meeting is lost.",
  "message.960a341cb4eb": "Cast Flame",
  "message.07e0a18cebfc": "Slip out now? The meeting is lost.",
  "message.7f8043617e5d": "Slip away",
  "message.decfb4bf29a4": "Compel them? Everything on the table is won, but after your next action they see what you did, and the meeting is lost unless that action wins it.",
  "message.1ee522748730": "Cast Compel",
  "message.743ac3b6cc56": "Leave the table? The meeting is lost.",
